Package: corrStability
Title: Zero-Imputation and Correlation Stability of Metabolite Variants
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Prashant", "Bhandari", email = "you@example.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools for wide-format metabolomics tables. Wraps a
    sample-by-metabolite data frame in a validated 'metabolite_set' object,
    imputes zeros, adds log-transformed variants, and computes pairwise
    correlations among all variants with summary statistics.
